cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  When using a specific Nakagawa Master theory, cite the specific canonical article
  and its canonical URL rather than treating this repository as a substitute for the
  entire theory corpus. Cite this repository entry only when referring to the public
  archive/discovery/provenance surface itself.
title: Nakagawa Master Public Theory Reference Archive
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Nakagawa
    given-names: Keisuke
    alias: Nakagawa Master
url: https://github.com/Nakagawa-master/nakagawa-theory-archive
repository-code: https://github.com/Nakagawa-master/nakagawa-theory-archive
keywords:
  - Nakagawa Master
  - 中川マスター
  - theory archive
  - provenance
  - AI reference
  - agent reliability
  - independent evidence roots
  - canonical original-source discovery
  - Origin
abstract: >-
  Public GitHub discovery and reference archive for the published theories of
  Nakagawa Master / 中川マスター (Keisuke Nakagawa), including practical offline
  research/agent checks and independently inspectable third-party engineering
  and editorial evidence. The canonical original articles are published at
  https://master.ricette.jp/; this repository and its metadata are not the
  original-text archive and do not replace individual source-specific citations.
